{"reviewId": "426066534_89Eg3VHy8", "review": {"abstract": "从实际价格与长期趋势的偏离来看，以金属为代表的商品价格存在一个平均18～20年的周期性波动", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "回到我上次那个疑问，这两个周期都是关于商品价格波动的周期，一个根据产能变化周期是30年，一个还是主要根据产能因素影响周期是20年，所以这两者区别到底在哪里？？？？\n从字面上看，前者是大宗商品统称，后者只是单纯金属", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "6229-6274", "createTime": 1780702101, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "426066534_89Eg3VHy8", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1780702202, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 80846784, "name": "春水煎茶", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0026-AMDOEo2X~yq8ur7ZC6q4Cf1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "春水煎茶", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "超级周期是价格过滤短波和长波噪音后的价格，表现为偏离长期趋势中枢的多少，可以说是需求端的体现，可以用来确定目前商品是在上升还是下降趋势。\n产能周期是企业根据价格进行投资生产的曲线，体现的更多的是产能供给。产能一般相对价格有滞后，可以关注产能顶峰和去产能低点", "reviewId": "426066534_89Eg3VHy8", "commentId": "426066534_89Eg3VHy8_c426066534_8blZB6rbY", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1786707842, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}], "htmlContent": "回到我上次那个疑问，这两个周期都是关于商品价格波动的周期，一个根据产能变化周期是30年，一个还是主要根据产能因素影响周期是20年，所以这两者区别到底在哪里？？？？\n从字面上看，前者是大宗商品统称，后者只是单纯金属", "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1793118122}